254
00:24:56,080 --> 00:24:58,200
Bueno, adiós.

255
00:24:58,280 --> 00:25:00,200
Adiós -
Adiós -

256
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:09,600
Tres, dos, uno.

257
00:26:14,520 --> 00:26:16,480
